#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
NORA offline ML/NLP intent analysis.

The pipeline keeps the held-out test partition isolated from feature fitting,
topic discovery, entity-candidate discovery and assistant-finding discovery.

Outputs:
- one JSON dictionary containing the complete analysis
- CSV review tables for each phase
- PNG charts for review/presentation

The implementation uses only local corpus-derived representations. UMAP and
HDBSCAN are used when already installed; otherwise clustering falls back to
KMeans without downloading anything.
"""

